en:
"I knew you'd come.
And what it is you're wishing for right now, too.
But in the end, it's all up to you guys, okay?"{w}

{0E}"Her brain plus my fortune-telling!
Even I have to admit it's the perfect plan!{0F}
Right... This time, I'm gonna win!"{w}

{0E}"...Would you kindly give it a rest?
...Could it be that you really are interested?{0F}
...Then... I do apologize..."{w}

"This is a device that measures the movements of the heavens
and gauges what kind of influence they have
on the land."{w}

{0E}"And Council Chair Wattner happened to see it...
Until just the other day, I had been demoted to a post in the provinces.{0F}
'The short-tempered have no place in the capital,' I was told."{w}{p}"It's the capital, so I do understand that...{w}But what is so wrong with research for the good of the land!?"{w}

"And besides, all that 'egghead, egghead' --
what exactly is wrong with that?"{w}{p}"That word might be a compliment, if anything,
but it could never be an insult.........Excuse me."{w}

{0E}"I have every confidence in my research.
Whenever you want to know the weather, just ask.{0F}
Though I will charge the facility fee."{w}

{0E}"Ah... and one more thing: watch out for storms.
Tornadoes only occur in certain places, but{0F}
they can easily blow a person away."{w}{p}"...I do worry about you, a little."{w}

{0E}"Yo! You lot dropped your wallet, right?
Say it again: you dropped it, right!{0F}
RIGHT!?"{w}

{0E}"...............Right, I'll pay ya back real soon!
Wait for me, okay!?{0F}
...............Don't... get your hopes up, though."{w}

{0E}"The ones puttin' on a good, harmless face,
they're the nastiest of the lot. Got it?{0F}
...Do ya really get it, though?"{w}

"Dear adventurers,{w}the other day, I heard from another patron..."{w}{p}"...that in the Giaf Dunes there is a bird
with a truly powerful cry."{w}{p}"They say those birds
eat the fleshy fruit of a plant that grows in the desert{w}to keep their voices strong."{w}{p}"That is what I was told."{w}

"From now on, I will sing the songs
that only I can sing, as I am now --
older, with the years piled up."{w}{p}"Adventurers,{w}thank you, truly!"{w}

"...and as head of this town's guard,
my creed is 'Non-Violence & Reform BY Dialogue'!"{w}{p}"No matter how vicious the criminal, as long as they've got a soul like ours,{w}a passionate heart and burning words
can always set them straight!"{w}

{0E}"...That said, we're short on people.
Chief Barjeff, show the guard some love already!{0F}
District Nine! Go! Run!"{w}

{0E}"Next time, let's go grab a bite together.
Don't worry, I've got at least that much breathing room............{0F}
What!? Sorry, we'll finish this another time!"{w}

"Love for your friends! Love for your neighbors! Love for neighboring nations!
Love for all! Love shall save the whole wide world!
Ah, what a splendid thing love is!"{w}

"A message from Chief Barjeff.{w}'Deliver this cargo to Empress Rianna
at the Roscadil palace,' it says."{w}{p}"It also said, 'As discreetly as you can.'{w}It's a rather bulky parcel, so it may be hard going,
but we're counting on you!"{w}

{0E}"Noraaa?{0F}
How's our customer doing... Aaaaaaah!
Aaaaaaah--!"{w}

"How's this ribbon, debuu?{w}I just bought it, debuu!{w}It's cute, debuu!"{w}{p}"When I make myself cute,
the customers praise me lots, debuu."{w}{p}"Uncle Barjeff
gives me pocket money too, debuu{w}I get pocket money and dress up all nice, debuu!"{w}

"...Sigh.{w}Customer, please say something to her too."{w}{p}"She's a girl, you know?{w}This just won't do..."{w}{p}"Hmm... customer,{w}would you happen to know anywhere that makes
panties Nora could wear?"{w}{p}"We'll pay for them,
so if it's not too much trouble, could you bring some here?"{w}{p}"...Before dressing up,{w}she needs to put on panties first..."{w}

"If you boil down ten of them and concentrate it,
you can use it in a slightly unusual way.{w}What way, you ask? That's a secret."{w}{p}"But...
I bet you'll be surprised."{w}

"Oh dear...
Without ten Stonemelt Waters, I can't give you
the special service..."{w}

{0E}"Huh? Are you sure?{0F}
Thank you so much!"{w}{p}"Thanks to you, everything's ready.{w}Just wait a moment...
Hup!"{w}

{0E}"...Is something wrong?{0F}
Hehe, what funny customers you are!"{w}{p}"Now then, I'm going to give you
a whooole lot of service!"{w}

"Oh, everyone!
Welcome!{w}How have you been?"{w}{p}"If you're ever tired,
I'll give you some special service anytime."{w}

"Not at all. This much is no trouble.{w}It's part of my duties, after all."{w}{p}"But what is it this time?
One thing after another."{w}{p}"Well, it's no concern of mine,
so I suppose I don't mind."{w}

"Ngh...
Defeating me changes nothing."{w}{p}"Hisbert must be judged.
You lot can stand there and watch, helpless."{w}

"With the Phase Shift drawing near, the Divine Realm too must turn to the creation of the Eld."{w}{p}"And neither Rogera nor Dehain is here, after all.
Even if it did go to Aznand,
heh heh heh..."{w}

"Thank you for worrying about me, Hilde."{w}{p}"I'll be fine. Besides,
he's very capable. Probably more than I am..."{w}{p}"Fufu. No one sane could ever do a librarian's job.
Brace yourself, Hevayur."{w}

"Nothing."{w}{p}"The thinking is up to everyone here."{w}{p}"Thank you, all of you, too.
For going along with my selfishness."{w}{p}"Maybe what I did was wrong.
But you know what?{w}I don't regret it..."{w}{p}"There's no answer anywhere yet.{w}Maybe you could..."{w}{p}"No. You'll find it, I know you will.{w}I believe in you."{w}

"Maybe we had some connection,
once upon a time."{w}{p}"Oh, I know. Since you're here,
I'll give you this as a keepsake."{w}

